// Single-row cross-container claim for the nightly sync. Replit Autoscale runs
// multiple containers, each with its own in-memory guard; an atomic conditional
// UPDATE on this row lets exactly ONE container win the nightly even when two
// fire their 2 AM cron in the same instant (a SELECT-then-decide check races).
